---
import { REGLAS_REGISTRO } from '@/data/hospedajes/caracteristicas';
---

<section class="py-12 md:py-20 bg-brand-bg border-b border-slate-200">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 lg:grid-cols-12 gap-8 items-center">
      
      <!-- Text side -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6 space-y-6">
        <span class="text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest text-rose-800 bg-rose-100 px-3 py-1 rounded-full">
          Protección y Tranquilidad
        </span>

        <h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-4xl font-black text-brand-blue tracking-tight leading-tight">
          Cada ocupante registrado. Ningún menor de edad, sin excepciones
        </h2>

        <p class="text-sm sm:text-base text-slate-700 leading-relaxed">
          El sistema exige el documento de <strong>todos los ocupantes</strong> que ingresan a la habitación, no únicamente de quien realiza el pago.
        </p>

        <div class="space-y-4">
          {REGLAS_REGISTRO.map((item) => (
            <div class="bg-white p-4 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 shadow-sm space-y-1">
              <h3 class="font-bold text-slate-900 text-sm flex items-center gap-2">
                <span class="text-brand-gold">●</span> {item.titulo}
              </h3>
              <p class="text-xs text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
                {item.descripcion}
              </p>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- Visual Callout Card with Real Tech Matrix Code Wallpaper (High Visibility) -->
      <div class="lg:col-span-6">
        <div class="bg-slate-950 text-white rounded-2xl p-6 sm:p-8 border border-slate-700 shadow-2xl space-y-5 relative overflow-hidden">
          
          <!-- Real Tech Code Wallpaper Background (Clearly Visible) -->
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[url('/images/bg-tech-grid.jpg')] bg-cover bg-center opacity-70 pointer-events-none"></div>
          <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-slate-950/85 via-slate-900/80 to-slate-950/85 backdrop-blur-[1px] pointer-events-none"></div>

          <div class="relative z-10 space-y-5">
            <div class="flex items-center justify-between border-b border-slate-700 pb-4">
              <div class="flex items-center gap-2">
                <div class="w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-rose-500"></div>
                <span class="font-bold text-sm text-slate-100">Control Estricto de Ocupantes</span>
              </div>
              <span class="text-xs text-slate-200 bg-slate-900/90 px-2.5 py-1 rounded-full border border-slate-700">Seguridad Total</span>
            </div>

            <!-- Simulated minor lock UI -->
            <div class="bg-slate-950/90 p-4 rounded-xl border border-rose-900/80 space-y-3 backdrop-blur-md shadow-lg">
              <div class="flex items-center justify-between text-xs">
                <span class="text-slate-300">Validación de Fecha de Nacimiento</span>
                <span class="text-rose-400 font-bold">Bloqueo Preventivo</span>
              </div>

              <div class="bg-rose-950/90 text-rose-200 p-3 rounded-lg text-xs border border-rose-800 space-y-1">
                <div class="font-bold flex items-center gap-1.5 text-rose-300">
                  <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-rose-400 flex-shrink-0" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z"/></svg>
                  <span>Ingreso no permitido: Ocupante menor de 18 años</span>
                </div>
                <p class="text-[11px] text-rose-300/90">
                  El sistema no permite guardar la asignación. El recepcionista no puede saltarse este control.
                </p>
              </div>

              <div class="text-[11px] text-slate-300 pt-1 flex items-center justify-between">
                <span>Huéspedes recurrentes:</span>
                <span class="text-emerald-400 font-semibold">Auto-completados por DNI</span>
              </div>
            </div>

            <p class="text-xs text-slate-300 italic">
              Sin fotos de documentos. Respeto absoluto a la privacidad y almacenamiento seguro.
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>

    </div>

  </div>
</section>
